  <running_head>DE SACRAMENTIS</running_head>
  <bottom_margin>
  </bottom_margin>
  <main_text>
    <l n="1">
      <i>Sacramenta porrhò sunt duplicia: ini-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="2">
      <i>tiationis, &amp; confirmationis.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="3" para="true">
      <i>Initiationis sacramentum est, quod se-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="4">
      <i>mel tantùm ufurpatum, sacramentum est</i>
    </l>
    <l n="5">
      <i>adoptionis seu infitionis in Christum, ac re-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="6">
      <i>ceptionis in album Populi Dei.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="7" para="true">Confirmationis <i>sacramétum est, quod</i>
    </l>
    <l n="8">
      <i>sæpius iteratum, sacramentum est augmenti</i>
    </l>
    <l n="9">
      <i>continui sive perpetuæ mansionis in Christo.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="10" para="true">
      <i>Alia autem fuerunt veteris, alia sunt</i>
    </l>
    <l n="11">
      <i>novi Testamenti sacramenta.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="12" para="true">Veteris Testamenti <i>sacramēta plura</i>
    </l>
    <l n="13">
      <i>fuerūt; ordinaria tamē hæc tria:</i> circum-</l>
    <l n="14">cifio, pascha, &amp; sacrificium expiatorium.</l>
    <l n="15" para="true">Circumcifio <i>fuit sacramentum veteris</i>
    </l>
    <l n="16">
      <i>Testamenti, in quo externâ præputii rese-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="17">
      <i>ctione, interna animæ à peccatis repurgatio,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="18">
      <i>atq; in venturum Christum incorporatio,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="19">
      <i>adoptioq; in populum Dei, obsignabatur.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="20">Gen.17.v.11.Rom.4.v.11.</l>
    <l n="21" para="true">Pascha, <i>fuit sacramentum, in quo ex-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="22">
      <i>ternâ properâq; agni assati manducatione,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="23">
      <i>continua in Christo vetuto nutritio &amp; vi-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="24">
      <i>vificatio cõfirmabatur.</i> Exo.12. 1 Cor.5.v.7.</l>
    <l n="25" para="true">Sacrificium expiatorium,</l>
    <l n="26">
      <i>fuit sacra-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="27">
      <i>mentum,</i>
    </l>
  </main_text>
  <notes>Catchword/continuation: last line "mentum," appears at the right, right-aligned. Some words in the scan are uncertain (e.g. "Christo vetuto" may read "vetero"). Long s rendered as s throughout.</notes>
